{"id":"c4847fa707cf73b8","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-dce-two-changes.md","title":"两个 c.e. 集合之差恰为 2-c.e.","display":"thm-dce-two-changes — 两个 c.e. 集合之差恰为 2-c.e.","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-dce-two-changes","aliases":["20-thm-dce-two-changes"],"display":"thm-dce-two-changes — 两个 c.e. 集合之差恰为 2-c.e.","chapter":"3","section":"3.8.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Definition 3.8.6 后的 n=2 说明","source_printed_pages":[75,76],"source_pdf_pages":[111,112],"depends_on":["[[20-df-nce]]","[[20-df-stages]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-dce-two-changes"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-dce-two-changes</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-dce-two-changes — 两个 c.e. 集合之差恰为 2-c.e."},{"key":"chapter","html":"3"},{"key":"section","html":"3.8.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Definition 3.8.6 后的 n=2 说明"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>75</span><span>76</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>111</span><span>112</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq\\omega\">\\(A\\subseteq\\omega\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f6085a9e9511e00a\" href=\"?note=f6085a9e9511e00a\" title=\"20-df-nce\">20-df-nce</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4ef1aee16db6b308\" href=\"?note=4ef1aee16db6b308\" title=\"20-df-stages\">20-df-stages</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dce-two-changes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DCE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{nCE}(A,2).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dce-two-changes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DCE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{nCE}(A,2).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\\setminus C\">\\(A=B\\setminus C\\)</span>，取递增枚举并近似 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\chi_{B_s\\setminus C_s}\">\\(\\chi_{B_s\\setminus C_s}\\)</span>；每个数从 0 开始，最多先进入再退出，因此至多两变。反向，枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 为曾取 1 的输入，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span> 为取 1 后又变成 0 的输入；起始为 0 且至多两变，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A=B\\setminus C\">\\(A=B\\setminus C\\)</span>。两个集合一致 c.e.，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\subseteq B\">\\(C\\subseteq B\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Definition 3.8.6 后的 n=2 说明；印刷页 75, 76；PDF 第 111, 112 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-nce]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-stages]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-nce","status":"resolved","id":"f6085a9e9511e00a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-stages","status":"resolved","id":"4ef1aee16db6b308","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-nce]]；see [[20-df-stages]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\subseteq\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}dce-two-changes}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{DCE}(A)\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{nCE}(A,2).","display":true},{"tex":"A=B\\setminus C","display":false},{"tex":"\\chi_{B_s\\setminus C_s}","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"C","display":false},{"tex":"A=B\\setminus C","display":false},{"tex":"C\\subseteq B","display":false}],"bytes":1262,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["f6085a9e9511e00a","4ef1aee16db6b308"]}